<html>
  <head>
    <style>
      :root {
        color-scheme: light;
        supported-color-schemes: light;
      }

      body {
        font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.8em;
        color: #484848;
        background: #FFFFFF;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }

      @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
        body {
          color: #484848 !important;
          background: #FFFFFF !important;
        }
      }

       h1, h2, h3 { font-family: "Trebuchet MS", Verdana, sans-serif; margin: 0px; }
      h1 { font-size: 1.2em; }
      h2, h3 { font-size: 1.1em; }
      h2.emailTitle { color: #1a67a3; font-size: 2em; }
      a, a:link, a:visited { color: #2A5685;}
      a:hover, a:active { color: #c61a1a; }
      a.op-uc-link_permalink { display: none; }
      hr {
        width: 100%;
        height: 1px;
        background: #ccc;
        border: 0;
      }
      blockquote {
        border-left: 3px solid #E0E0E0;
        font-style: italic;
        margin-left: 2.4em;
        padding-left: 0.6em;
      }
      pre {
        white-space: normal;
      }
      img {
        width: 100%;
      }

      .footer {
        font-size: 0.8em;
        font-style: italic;
        border-top-width: 1px;
        border-top-color: #ccc;
        border-top-style: solid;
        text-align: center;
        padding-top: 10px;
      }

      .footer-note {
        border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee;
        padding-top: 20px;
        margin-top: 20px !important;
        color: #777777;
        text-align: justify;
      }

      .title {
        margin-top: 10px;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .copyright {
        margin-bottom: 10px;
        color: #777777;
      }

      .logo {
        height: 30px;
        width: auto;
        vertical-align: middle;

      }

    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <%= image_tag(attachments['logo.svg'].url, alt: 'Plannerus', class:"logo") %>

      </div>

      <div class="content">
        <% if title %>
          <h2 class="title"><%= title %></h2>
        <% end %>

        <%= yield %>

        <div class="footer-note">
          Αυτό είναι ένα αυτοματοποιημένο μήνυμα. Παρακαλούμε μην απαντήσετε σε αυτό το μήνυμα ηλεκτρονικού ταχυδρομείου.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- <div class="copyright">
        © Alpha Omega Zed Project Management
      </div> -->
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
